; ========================================
; ＞『医務室』を選択
; ========================================

; ========================================
; [bgm Bgm_011_001_Loop]
; ========================================
@AutoSave
[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛和雪莉跟着地图，<br>前往一楼的医务室。|#0101Adv14_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Duration:0 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:7_2
@ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#000000 Duration:1.2 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:Transparent SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:1.8
@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_11_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:走进医务室，迎面飘来的不是药品的气味，<br>而是一股沁人的香气。|#0101Adv14_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:室内洒满了阳光，<br>让人感受到难得的心神安宁。|#0101Adv14_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（还有这样的好地方……<br>　不是所有地方都那么糟糕，真是太好了）|#0101Adv14_Ema001|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:安安躺在床上睡着了。<br>梅露露和蕾雅也在。|#0101Adv14_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Default
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:啊，艾玛小姐，雪莉小姐……！|#0101Adv14_Meruru001| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:还想着怎么不见梅露露你，<br>原来你在这里啊。|#0101Adv14_Sherry001| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Pensive

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯……听说安安小姐情况不太好，<br>我安不下心来，就……对不起。|#0101Adv14_Meruru002| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:梅露露小声说道，把头低了下来。|#0101Adv14_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:你不用道歉啦！<br>梅露露你很棒哦！|#0101Adv14_Sherry002| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:讲、讲讲讲讲太过了……|#0101Adv14_Meruru003| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:安安她一直都待在这里吗？<br>情况怎么样了。|#0101Adv14_Ema002| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:她发了高烧……我们遇到典狱长大人，<br>它听了我们的情况就说，与其留她在自己房间，<br>不如带来医务室这边休息还比较好。|#0101Adv14_Meruru004| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这样啊……它还蛮心善的。|#0101Adv14_Ema003| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛和雪莉走到了<br>安安的床边。|#0101Adv14_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:是你们啊。|#0101Adv14_Leia001| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:请问，安安她没事吧？|#0101Adv14_Ema004| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:说不上情况很好……<br>不过，梅露露她真的出了很多力。|#0101Adv14_Leia002| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile1,ArmR5,ArmL2

[PrintTextModified Text:中庭那边植物长得很茂盛，<br>她就跑去那边摘香草，给我们泡茶。<br>多亏有她，现在大家感觉很安心。|#0101Adv14_Leia003| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:欸，梅露露好厉害耶！|#0101Adv14_Sherry003| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:"（所以这里才飘着一股<br>　柔和的香气啊）|#0101Adv14_Ema005|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:中庭……说来，我记得过道中间<br>有一个地方是可以走出去的。|#0101Adv14_Sherry004| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯，那里是个气氛很好的地方。<br>想去的话我可以带路。|#0101Adv14_Leia004| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ========================================
; [back 28]
; ========================================

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Duration:1.2 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:28_1

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛和雪莉跟着蕾雅<br>来到了中庭。|#0101Adv14_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:虽然四周被墙壁包围，<br>但是没有天花板的遮挡，可以看得见天空。|#0101Adv14_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:也能看到这里的二楼各处都设置了阳台，<br>便于呼吸新鲜空气。|#0101Adv14_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Ema.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:（是外面的空气……！）|#0101Adv14_Ema006| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:见到这座绿意满盈的庭院，<br>一直待在密闭空间里的艾玛，不禁深深吸了一口这里的空气。|#0101Adv14_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:虽然这边是封闭空间，<br>但是也可以走正门去到外面。|#0101Adv14_Leia005| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:那是个充满自然气息的美景。<br>我觉得那边的开放感会更好哦。|#0101Adv14_Leia006| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Surprised1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:面对蕾雅笑容满面给出的建议，<br>艾玛和雪莉对视了一眼。|#0101Adv14_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我们还以为<br>正门肯定是锁着的呢。|#0101Adv14_Ema007| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Normal1,ArmR5,ArmL1

[PrintTextModified Text:好像在放风时间里<br>是真的允许我们自由地四处转转的。|#0101Adv14_Leia007| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:只不过，在禁止外出时间内<br>玄关还是会上锁的。|#0101Adv14_Leia008| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ========================================
; [sfx 8：フクロウの羽ばたき音]
; ========================================

@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_8 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:在她们聊得正火热时，上空传来了翅膀拍动的声音。<br>于是艾玛她们抬头往上看。<br>和心里想的一样，是典狱长来了。|#0101Adv14_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Warden

[PrintTextModified Text:哎呀，这不是樱羽艾玛小姐，<br>橘雪莉小姐，还有莲见蕾雅小姐吗。|#0101Adv14_Warden001| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Angry1,ArmR1,ArmL1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:35 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Surprised1,ArmR3,ArmL1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:65 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:典狱长……|#0101Adv14_Ema008| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:看到典狱长出现，蕾雅警戒起来，<br>露出恶狠狠的表情站在二人面前，摆出要保护她们两个的样子。|#0101Adv14_Narrative013| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我们有老实遵守规定生活。<br>没有做任何坏事。|#0101Adv14_Leia009| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Warden

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯，希望你们继续保持下去。<br>这里可是个好地方，<br>希望你们可以好好享受这里的生活。|#0101Adv14_Warden002| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Angry1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:35 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:65 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:典狱长忽然出现，<br>艾玛和蕾雅二人的表情都十分紧张，<br>但雪莉此时却是两眼放光。|#0101Adv14_Narrative014| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:65 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Smile1,ArmR1,ArmL6
@EmoteJumpDouble ActorIds:Sherry Loop:false Speed:1

[PrintTextModified Text:遇到你真的好幸运耶！<br>典狱长，我可以问你几个问题吗！|#0101Adv14_Sherry005| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这座建筑物相当古老呢。<br>典狱长，时间这么久了，<br>你应该见过好几批关进这里的囚犯吧？|#0101Adv14_Sherry006| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:曾经被关在这里的囚犯，最后都变成怎样了！？|#0101Adv14_Sherry007| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这座监牢又是为了什么目的建成的！？<br>请你告诉我～！|#0101Adv14_Sherry008| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Warden

[PrintTextModified Text:……哎呀呀。<br>唉，看你们什么都不知道，也是蛮可怜的。|#0101Adv14_Warden003| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:虽然我现在没什么时间……<br>不过，我就告诉你们一点点吧。|#0101Adv14_Warden004| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这座监牢呢，已经有500年的历史了。|#0101Adv14_Warden005| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Angry1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:35 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:65 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Surprised1,ArmR1,ArmL1

[PrintTextModified Text:500年！？|#0101Adv14_Sherry009| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:怪不得破旧成这样……|#0101Adv14_Leia010| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Warden

[PrintTextModified Text:当时这里还不是囚禁魔女的地方，<br>而是魔女们正常生活的一间大宅子。|#0101Adv14_Warden006| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:以大魔女为中心，<br>许许多多的魔女曾经在这里幸福地生活着。|#0101Adv14_Warden007| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:虽然摸不透它究竟有没有情感，<br>但从它平和的语气来看，它似乎也相当怀念过去的事情。|#0101Adv14_Narrative015| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:某天，有一个和魔女不一样的种族——<br>也就是人类，来到这座岛上时，魔女们也是<br>在这个中庭里开展茶会，欢迎他们的到来。|#0101Adv14_Warden008| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Angry1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:35 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:65 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:那为什么这里就变成了关押囚犯的监牢呢？|#0101Adv14_Sherry010| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Warden

[PrintTextModified Text:呃，那是因为大魔女她——哎呀，<br>说太多了也不好呢。我就告辞了。|#0101Adv14_Warden009| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

